{0, u, u} k a) (HSMul.hSMul.{0, u, u} k b)","unsafe":false,"value":382,"source":{"code":"theorem nsmul_le_nsmul {k : Nat} {a b : M} (h : a ≤ b) : k • a ≤ k • b := by\n  induction k with\n  | zero => simp [zero_nsmul, le_refl]\n  | succ k ih =>\n    rw [add_nsmul, one_nsmul, add_nsmul, one_nsmul]\n    exact le_trans ((add_le_left_iff a).mp ih) ((add_le_right_iff (k • b)).mp h)","start":84,"end":89},"axioms":["propext"]}